@startuml KTOB_16_state_offer
title KTOB — Saved Offer Lifecycle
[*] --> OBSERVED : verified source listing found
OBSERVED --> SAVED : reader saves
OBSERVED --> [*] : dismissed
SAVED --> RECHECKED : reader revisits / refreshes
RECHECKED --> SAVED : keep historical observation
SAVED --> REMOVED : reader removes
RECHECKED --> REMOVED : reader removes
REMOVED --> [*]
note right of SAVED
Saved price and availability are last observed,
not live guarantees. Seller click is not purchase.
end note
note right of RECHECKED
Availability may change or be unknown.
No automatic acquisition is inferred.
end note
@enduml
